        "instruction_raw": "左手拿起沙发左侧长条状灰色枕头@Pick up the long gray pillow on the left side of the sofa with your left hand. 左手拿起沙发左侧长条状灰色枕头，竖放在沙发左侧靠背上@Pick up the long gray pillow on the left side of the sofa with your left hand and place it vertically against the left backrest of the sofa. 左手拿起沙发左侧长条状灰色枕头@Pick up the long gray pillow on the left side of the sofa with your left hand. 左手拿起沙发左侧长条状灰色枕头，右手配合横放在沙发左手靠背上@Pick up the long gray pillow on the left side of the sofa with your left hand, and place it horizontally on the left armrest with your right hand. 本体向右移动到沙发右侧平躺灰色枕头前@Move body right to the front of the flat gray pillow on the right side of the sofa. 双手配合扶起沙发右侧平躺的枕头，靠在沙发右后侧靠背上@Grasp the pillow lying flat on the right side of the sofa with both hands and lean it against the right rear backrest.",
